---
---
<section aria-labelledby="proof-heading" class="px-6 pt-16">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="relative rounded-3xl p-10 md:p-14 overflow-hidden bg-white/60 border border-[#301B69]/10 shadow-sm">

      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-1 text-xs rounded-full bg-[#301B69]/8 text-[#301B69] mb-4" aria-hidden="true">
          ✦ SEE IT WORK
        </div>
        <h2 id="proof-heading" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#301B69] mb-3">
          From document to deployed agent — in under 10 minutes
        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- 3-panel sequence -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-10">
        <!-- Panel 1: Upload -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#301B69]/10 bg-white p-6 flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#301B69]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#301B69]">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="17 8 12 3 7 8"/><line x1="12" y1="3" x2="12" y2="15"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#301B69]/50 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Step 1</p>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-[#301B69] mb-2">Upload</h3>
            <div class="text-xs text-[#301B69]/60 bg-[#301B69]/5 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 font-mono">
              📄 Refund Policy.pdf
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Panel 2: Train -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#301B69]/10 bg-white p-6 flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#301B69]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#301B69]">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#301B69]/50 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Step 2</p>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-[#301B69] mb-2">Train</h3>
            <div class="text-xs text-[#301B69]/60 bg-[#301B69]/5 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 font-mono">
              Processing… 47 chunks indexed ✓
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Panel 3: Answer -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#301B69]/10 bg-white p-6 flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#301B69]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#301B69]">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#301B69]/50 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Step 3</p>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-[#301B69] mb-2">Answer</h3>
            <div class="text-left text-xs bg-[#301B69]/5 rounded-lg p-3 space-y-1.5">
              <p class="text-[#301B69]/60"><span class="font-medium">Customer:</span> Can I return after 30 days?</p>
              <p class="text-[#301B69]"><span class="font-medium">Agent:</span> Our return window is 30 days from delivery…</p>
              <p class="text-[#301B69]/40 text-[10px]">Source: Refund Policy.pdf</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-center text-[#301B69]/70 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        No prompt engineering. No fine-tuning. No infrastructure. You uploaded a document — your customers got accurate answers.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
